{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415670","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415670","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1041567001:1":{"text":"没想到这里还有这样的好地方。","source_cn":"没想到这里还有这样的好地方。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34A1793AD3687F53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041567002:1":{"text":"还不错吧？平时都是我亲手打理，节日的时候也会替换装饰，还有限定菜单！","source_cn":"还不错吧？平时都是我亲手打理，节日的时候也会替换装饰，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A1B2D6ED56326D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041567003:1":{"text":"对了，你要喝点什么吗？无论什么口味我都能做出来！","source_cn":"对了，你要喝点什么吗？无论什么口味我都能做出来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC55E8302FA6101A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041567004:1":{"text":"当然了，我很想试试，你有什么推荐的？","source_cn":"当然了，我很想试试，你有什么推荐的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15E2FB588A1D60CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041567005:1":{"text":"你喜欢怎样的口味？","source_cn":"你喜欢怎样的口味？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68A1BCD5861D1182","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:104156700